---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclosures"
  description="Important disclosures for StockSummarizer: not financial advice, affiliate relationships, and advertising."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold">Disclosures</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink-muted">Last updated: September 12, 2026</p>

    <section class="mt-10 space-y-4 text-[1.05rem] leading-7">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Not financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on StockSummarizer is for education and information only. It is <strong>not</strong> personalized investment,
        tax, or legal advice. We do not provide buy/sell recommendations as a product. Investing involves risk, including the
        possible loss of principal. Do your own research and consider consulting a qualified professional.
      </p>

      <h2 id="affiliates" class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Affiliate relationships</h2>
      <p>
        We may earn a commission when you click certain links or sign up for products from brokers, screeners, data tools,
        or learning platforms. Affiliate relationships never dictate coverage. We aim to recommend only tools that fit a
        clarity-first DIY investor audience. Partner list will be updated here as placements go live.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-border bg-surface-soft p-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">
        Affiliate partner slots — placeholder. No active tracked offers yet.
      </div>

      <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        Pages may include advertisement placeholders that will later host third-party or direct-sold ads.
        Ads are labeled. Free briefs will remain freely readable.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Accuracy & corrections</h2>
      <p>
        We strive for sourced, accurate summaries. Markets move; figures can become stale quickly.
        If we get a fact wrong, we correct it. Reach out via the contact path listed on the About page when available.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Ebooks & digital products</h2>
      <p>
        Paid guides are educational frameworks — not personalized advice and not a paywall on daily briefs.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
